:name: micro:bit V2 close sibling (nRF52840 model) - lab 16
:description: Runs the lab 16 firmware (built for the nRF52833) on Renode's nRF52840 model.
:description: NOT a micro:bit: no LED matrix, buttons, sensors, interface MCU or radio peer.

using sysbus
mach create "microbit-v2-sibling"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/microbit-v2-sibling.repl

$bin?=$ORIGIN/../firmware/target/thumbv7em-none-eabihf/release/fixed
sysbus LoadELF $bin

showAnalyzer uart0
start
